      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Two cases of haematocolpos in adolescent girls due to imperforate hymen are reported. Both of them presented with lower abdominal pain and urinary retention. Hymenotomy was performed in both the cases. The condition is discussed with brief review of literature."},
